h!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289250/extras/6fc074a4f12b0e1406ec4341c1f82637.poster.avif?t=1750561139\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289250/extras/6fc074a4f12b0e1406ec4341c1f82637.webm?t=1750561139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289250/extras/6fc074a4f12b0e1406ec4341c1f82637.mp4?t=1750561139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also have to plunge into the stories of ordinary people who visited these places and remained there forever as prisoners of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289250/extras/dcb655f83661af6145cd20879037563a.poster.avif?t=1750561139\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289250/extras/dcb655f83661af6145cd20879037563a.webm?t=1750561139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289250/extras/dcb655f83661af6145cd20879037563a.mp4?t=1750561139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your things as well as those objects that you can discover and find - you will have to create, as well as combine things and devices that will help you pass these tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289250/extras/1e53c1d028fc0a2dd030d257dfb67bf5.poster.avif?t=1750561139\" width=800 height=450 ><source 